librustyaxe (0.1.0-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add reusable rr_transport native OpenSSL/wslay WebSocket client.
  * Verify TLS peers and support guarded HTTP 307 redirects.
  * Resolve DNS in a worker to keep transport polling nonblocking.
  * Add native WebSocket loopback test.

