librustyaxe (0.1.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Enable the optional Mongoose compatibility backend using the distribution's
    mongoose-webserver-source build dependency.
  * Record backend availability in the installed SDK build configuration.
  * Keep public headers independent of private Mongoose include paths.
  * Document the GPLv2 obligations for Mongoose-enabled binaries.

